<h1>Aurealis Listings</h1>

<i>Aurealis, Australian Fantasy & Science Fiction</i>, is an
Australian semiprozine, edited by Stephen Higgins and Dirk Strasser.
It has published a number of stories by the new stars of Australian
science fiction such as: Greg Egan, Sean McMullen, Terry Dowling,
and Stephen Dedman.
<p>
Issues are <i>very</i> Australian, including Australian-related SF
news, reviews of Australian SF, as well as guidelines in helping
Australian writers crack the foreign markets. A 4-issue subscription
is $28.00 (Australian), with a 30% surcharge for overseas orders.
Back issues (1-14) are available for $6.00, while issue 15 is $7.00.
Order from:
<pre>
        Chimaera Publications
	PO Box 2164
	Waverley VIC 3149, Australia
</pre>
They also have a webpage at <a href="http://www.aurealis.hl.net">http://www.aurealis.hl.net</a>
